[{:db/id "q-80139/selection/a772c241184bf78af1b8f4169f67fa4c6e8c3f60fa0e4f4ee48026f3b98aab8c" :answer/id #uuid "0ab65c53-0fbf-5009-8743-753d86e9efcd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{6})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80139/selection/5152b5d24ab083faa2cf2ed017516e4e90a1da441634e48cf345be0e113c63e9" :answer/id #uuid "2bcc24d2-9ad3-5cc3-a79c-767cd72b0c66" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{6})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80139/selection/3a84073ef9ef528b833f5e15c46da7e2a259a5e3c2baaf849f79f240268873f8" :answer/id #uuid "a89c0c94-80d1-5507-bdb8-8f743f468818" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{3})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80139/selection/206b044527c20711e1c54b1fec42efad98ff2372795e97cea8282f2150cd30e7" :answer/id #uuid "6533a720-07a1-5e1f-96f6-d5f1c1463a30" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{3})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80139/selection/e859a09acf3ac5e3e582318d5f00e367f97b7c06dd7abfa75578d5e5f249cd03" :answer/id #uuid "f6551817-0c5a-5911-a94e-2ef5f96e7f7c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{3})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80139/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "28d0c73e-8e7a-52a7-afbf-abd2325b9421" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-80139/selection/3a84073ef9ef528b833f5e15c46da7e2a259a5e3c2baaf849f79f240268873f8" :answer-field/choices ["q-80139/selection/a772c241184bf78af1b8f4169f67fa4c6e8c3f60fa0e4f4ee48026f3b98aab8c" "q-80139/selection/5152b5d24ab083faa2cf2ed017516e4e90a1da441634e48cf345be0e113c63e9" "q-80139/selection/3a84073ef9ef528b833f5e15c46da7e2a259a5e3c2baaf849f79f240268873f8" "q-80139/selection/206b044527c20711e1c54b1fec42efad98ff2372795e97cea8282f2150cd30e7" "q-80139/selection/e859a09acf3ac5e3e582318d5f00e367f97b7c06dd7abfa75578d5e5f249cd03"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-80139" :question/id #uuid "44a821f8-71fd-5b81-8104-bbf058394911" :question/math-academy-id "q-80139" :question/problem "$\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=$" :question/worked-solution "The difference formula for sine gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}R\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-ϕ) & =R(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ) \\\\  & =R\\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-R\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, by writing the given expression in the amplitude-phase form\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=R\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-ϕ),\n$$\n\nwe get the following identity:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=(R\\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ)\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-(R\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ)\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\n$$\n\nEquating the coefficients of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ and $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x,$ we get the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}R\\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ=1 \\\\ R\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ=\\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDividing the second equation by the first, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{R\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ}{R\\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ} & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{1} \\\\ \\operatorname{tan}⁡ϕ & =\\sqrt{3} \\\\ ϕ & =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we find the amplitude $R.$ Squaring the first and the second equations of the system and adding the results together, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(R\\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ)}^{2}+{(R\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ)}^{2} & ={1}^{2}+(\\sqrt{3})^{2} \\\\ {R}^{2}({cos}^{2}⁡ϕ+{sin}^{2}⁡ϕ) & =1+3 \\\\ {R}^{2} & =4 \\\\ R & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that we only consider the positive root since $R>0.$\n\nFinally, we can write the initial expression in amplitude-phase form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{3})\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-80139/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "65b4e8e7-e558-50e7-a1ec-37a6eff77e87"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-80139"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-274608/field-1/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer/id #uuid "510f8494-5958-5cca-83ba-93db0b677a6b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186281875 :answer-field/choices ["q-274608/field-1/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]}]
